#: {{syn|en|spoken|verbal}}
#: {{ant|en|written}}
#: {{ux|en|an '''oral''' presentation}}{{ux|en|an '''oral''' French exam}}
## Relating to the [[transmission]] of [[information]] or [[literature]] by word of [[mouth]].
## Using [[speech]] or the [[lip]]s especially in [[teach]]ing the [[deaf]].
## {{lb|en|sociolinguistics|of a [[society]]}} Not having [[reach]]ed the [[stage]] of [[literacy]].

